      "tag": "Name",
      "h2": "Me Llamo",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>Me llamo</strong> + name. 'Me llamo Sam'. Ask: <strong>Como te llamas?</strong> — informal. Note the double 'll' sounds like 'y' in 'yes'.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "How",
      "h2": "How Are You?",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>Como estas?</strong> = How are you? Reply: <strong>Estoy bien</strong> (I'm well) or <strong>asi asi</strong> (so-so). Then ask back: <strong>Y tu?</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Meet",
      "h2": "Pleased to Meet You",
      "body_html": "<p>When meeting someone new, say <strong>Mucho gusto</strong> — 'pleased to meet you'. In Spain, kiss each cheek (a girl) or shake hands.</p>"
    }
